        {
          "id": 2529114045,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I think this inverts the meaning! For example:\n```\n    #ifdef BUILD_SHARED_LIBS\n      /*\n       * We're building all-static, so we're not building any DLLs.\n       */\n```\n`BUILD_SHARED_LIBS` means we're *not* building all-static and we *are* building DLLs. But that's not the only case.",
